-- Tests for Dieu 144-154. V1 pinned at 1 June 2025, V2 at 1 March 2026, V3 at 1 August 2026.

§ `Tests: Chuong V and VI`

§§ `Dieu 144`

-- src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:291 | Điều 144. Đặc điểm của sản phẩm bảo hiểm vi mô
-- src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:292 | Sản phẩm bảo hiểm vi mô có các đặc điểm cơ bản sau đây:
-- src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:293 | 1. Được thiết kế ngắn gọn, dễ hiểu, có thủ tục thẩm định bảo hiểm đơn giản
-- src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:294 | hoặc không cần thẩm định bảo hiểm;
-- src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:295 | 2. Chỉ bao gồm các quyền lợi nhằm đáp ứng nhu cầu bảo vệ cơ bản trước các
-- src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:296 | rủi ro về tính mạng, sức khỏe và tài sản của người tham gia bảo hiểm với thời hạn
-- src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:297 | bảo hiểm không quá 05 năm;
-- src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:298 | CÔNG BÁO/Số 577 + 578/Ngày 17-7-2022 11
-- src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:300 | 3. Số tiền bảo hiểm trên từng hợp đồng và phí bảo hiểm hằng năm cho từng
-- src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:301 | người được bảo hiểm của một hợp đồng không vượt quá mức tối đa theo quy định
-- src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:302 | của Chính phủ.
@ref Dieu 144 (src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:291-302)
`a micro product at every limit` MEANS `A microinsurance product` WITH
    `is short and easy to understand with simple or no underwriting` IS TRUE
    `covers only the basic protection of life, health and property` IS TRUE
    `term in years` IS 5
    `sum insured per contract` IS 20_000_000
    `annual premium per insured person of a contract` IS 1_000_000
    `maximum sum insured per contract the Government sets` IS JUST 20_000_000
    `maximum annual premium per insured person the Government sets` IS JUST 1_000_000
`a micro product of six years` MEANS `A microinsurance product` WITH
    `is short and easy to understand with simple or no underwriting` IS TRUE
    `covers only the basic protection of life, health and property` IS TRUE
    `term in years` IS 6
    `sum insured per contract` IS 20_000_000
    `annual premium per insured person of a contract` IS 1_000_000
    `maximum sum insured per contract the Government sets` IS JUST 20_000_000
    `maximum annual premium per insured person the Government sets` IS JUST 1_000_000
`a micro product over the sum cap` MEANS `A microinsurance product` WITH
    `is short and easy to understand with simple or no underwriting` IS TRUE
    `covers only the basic protection of life, health and property` IS TRUE
    `term in years` IS 1
    `sum insured per contract` IS 20_000_001
    `annual premium per insured person of a contract` IS 1_000_000
    `maximum sum insured per contract the Government sets` IS JUST 20_000_000
    `maximum annual premium per insured person the Government sets` IS JUST 1_000_000
`a micro product over the premium cap` MEANS `A microinsurance product` WITH
    `is short and easy to understand with simple or no underwriting` IS TRUE
    `covers only the basic protection of life, health and property` IS TRUE
    `term in years` IS 1
    `sum insured per contract` IS 20_000_000
    `annual premium per insured person of a contract` IS 1_000_001
    `maximum sum insured per contract the Government sets` IS JUST 20_000_000
    `maximum annual premium per insured person the Government sets` IS JUST 1_000_000
`a micro product that is complex` MEANS `A microinsurance product` WITH
    `is short and easy to understand with simple or no underwriting` IS FALSE
    `covers only the basic protection of life, health and property` IS TRUE
    `term in years` IS 1
    `sum insured per contract` IS 0
    `annual premium per insured person of a contract` IS 0
    `maximum sum insured per contract the Government sets` IS JUST 20_000_000
    `maximum annual premium per insured person the Government sets` IS JUST 1_000_000
`a micro product with no caps supplied` MEANS `A microinsurance product` WITH
    `is short and easy to understand with simple or no underwriting` IS TRUE
    `covers only the basic protection of life, health and property` IS TRUE
    `term in years` IS 1
    `sum insured per contract` IS 0
    `annual premium per insured person of a contract` IS 0
    `maximum sum insured per contract the Government sets` IS NOTHING
    `maximum annual premium per insured person the Government sets` IS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Dieu 144: the product has the characteristics of a microinsurance product` `a micro product at every limit`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 144: the product has the characteristics of a microinsurance product` `a micro product of six years`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 144: the product has the characteristics of a microinsurance product` `a micro product over the sum cap`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 144: the product has the characteristics of a microinsurance product` `a micro product over the premium cap`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 144: the product has the characteristics of a microinsurance product` `a micro product that is complex`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 144: the product has the characteristics of a microinsurance product` `a micro product with no caps supplied`

§§ `Dieu 145 to 150`

